# Kept locally, not committed: third-party distributions (redistribution), binary coverage
# databases (their JSON/XML reports are committed), SAST source snapshots (duplicates of the
# committed source), superseded raw V8 captures and bytecode caches. Their sha256 hashes are
# recorded in the adjacent receipts (install*/preparation.json, sast*/source-inputs.json).
artifacts/install*/wheels/
artifacts/install*/sdists/
artifacts/coverage/*.coverage
artifacts/coverage/js-v8/
artifacts/coverage/js-review-v8/
artifacts/security/sast*/source/
__pycache__/
